          "text": "(cschem\n    (component R1 resistor 30 50\n        (pin 1 −5 0)\n        (pin 2 5 0)\n    )\n    (component A1 virtual:opamp 200 100\n        (pin + −5 −5)\n        (pin − −5 5)\n        (pin out 5 0)\n    )\n    (component A1 container:opamp 200 500)\n        (pin Vdd 5 −5)\n        (pin Vss −5 5)\n    )\n    (component J1 connector:2 100 50)\n        (pin 1 0 −5)\n        (pin 2 0 5)\n    )\n    (net A1+ (A1 +) (R1 1))\n    (net A1– (A1 –) (R1 2) (A1 out))\n    (net +5V (A1 Vdd) (J1 1))\n    (net Gnd (A1 Vss) (J1 2))\n)",
